# Site content

Do not build the learning website until Phase 1–2 Pass A/B pilots exist.

When implementing `site/`: prefer static public content; keep progress local-first; never run executable vulnerable labs on the public content origin; treat MDX as code; meet WCAG 2.2 on security-sensitive journeys; include CSP, headers, telemetry, dependency, and deployment provenance in the security bar.

No real secrets, user PII, or production targets in exercises.
